            "A viability review should include the perspective of those who bear the costs. Communities may experience the effects of water allocation, border controls, resource extraction, debt restructuring, or security arrangements before national indicators show stress. Consultation and accessible grievance procedures can reveal those impacts. The process must also protect people from retaliation and respect applicable law concerning personal information and security.",
